  "footnotes": [
    {
      "id": "FOOT1",
      "reference": "DOCF1",
      "attachTo": "Linking-libraries",
      "words": 24,
      "pre": 0,
      "html": "<h5 class=\"footnote-body-heading\"><a href=\"#DOCF1\" id=\"FOOT1\">(1)</a></h5>\n<p>If you don’t\nspecify an <code class=\"code\">rpath</code>, then libtool builds a libtool convenience\narchive, not a shared library (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"#Static-libraries\">Linking static libraries</a>).</p>",
      "sha256": "2957105b173bfece4f5978532053fd26ded8c91e21b68cf09bc3b17541883f3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "FOOT2",
      "reference": "DOCF2",
      "attachTo": "Linking-executables",
      "words": 45,
      "pre": 0,
      "html": "<h5 class=\"footnote-body-heading\"><a href=\"#DOCF2\" id=\"FOOT2\">(2)</a></h5>\n<p>However, you should avoid using\n<samp class=\"option\">-L</samp> or <samp class=\"option\">-l</samp> flags to link against an uninstalled libtool\nlibrary.  Just specify the relative path to the <samp class=\"file\">.la</samp> file, such as\n<samp class=\"file\">../intl/libintl.la</samp>.  This is a design decision to eliminate any\nambiguity when linking against uninstalled shared libraries.</p>",
      "sha256": "d3dae8f554ac6151f7b2ac5367f2682e7fc5eba8ee53aebc81e46487ba321b3e"
    },
    {
      "id": "FOOT3",
      "reference": "DOCF3",
      "attachTo": "Linking-executables",
      "words": 13,
      "pre": 0,
      "html": "<h5 class=\"footnote-body-heading\"><a href=\"#DOCF3\" id=\"FOOT3\">(3)</a></h5>\n<p>And why should we? <samp class=\"file\">main.o</samp> doesn’t directly depend on <samp class=\"option\">-lm</samp>\nafter all.\n</p>",
      "sha256": "d1f64a2908c4788f6ff75031922e79a57d7d317d6a20cba9f1648fc42031230a"
    },
    {
      "id": "FOOT4",
      "reference": "DOCF4",
      "attachTo": "Installing-libraries",
      "words": 11,
      "pre": 0,
      "html": "<h5 class=\"footnote-body-heading\"><a href=\"#DOCF4\" id=\"FOOT4\">(4)</a></h5>\n<p>Don’t\nstrip static libraries though, or they will be unusable.</p>",
      "sha256": "96ab937ec3525d5be05c9eb08bce04b1e018bddd23a70f5b0f9ecf67bc345ff7"
    }
  ],
